%C - RP1 MSI-X configuration utility (SDP 7.1, no pci-server needed)

Syntax:
%C [options]

Options:
   -i irq[,irq...]  RP1 IRQs to enable (default 6,31,36). RP1 irq n is
                    delivered as GIC interrupt 160+n.
   -B               Only print the PCI address at which RP1 sees host RAM
                    (the value for the io-usb-otg "bmstr=" option)
   -c               Disable RP1 MSI-X
   -v               Increase verbosity (repeat for a register dump)

Requires "pciex4_reset=0" in config.txt so that the firmware leaves the
PCIe link to RP1 configured.

Example - ethernet (irq 6), USB host 0 (irq 31) and USB host 1 (irq 36):
   %C -i 6,31,36
